.Dd November 20, 2026
.Dt PTYD 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm ptyd
.Nd RavenBSD pseudo-terminal pair server
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
registers the
.Dq pty:
scheme and serves paired master and slave endpoints.
Opening
.Dq pty:master
or
.Dq pty:slave
allocates a pair; the numbered forms
.Dq pty:master/<id>
and
.Dq pty:slave/<id>
select an existing pair.
.Pp
The server implements the standard terminal requests
.Dv SET_MODE ,
.Dv GET_MODE
and
.Dv FLUSH ,
plus the pair-local foreground and hangup requests used by
.Xr forkpty 3
and the session leader.
Closing the last slave endpoint hangs up the pair so the master reads
end-of-file; the kernel
.Dv PROC_CTTY_SET
path makes the slave the child's controlling terminal.
.Pp
The server is started by
.Xr svcd 8
and is used by
.Xr openpty 3 ,
.Xr forkpty 3
and the login session path.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr svcd 8
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
server first appeared in RavenBSD 0.1.0.
